    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fror70_ONgoin9In_f_ouOBBkasW.jpg"><p><span>【</span><a href="https://hao.qunjielong.com/jump-mp.html?appId=wx059cd327295ab444&amp;ghName=gh_38274c71b09c&amp;miniFullPath=pro%2Fpages%2Fseq-detail%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%3FhotPointValue%3Da25c2a391b799e6fa1269daeee75b39d%26actId%3D2509180813303542%26inviteUid%3D11220258%26fromShare%3D1%26shareScene%3D10004%26shareByLink%3D1" data-url="https://hao.qunjielong.com/jump-mp.html?appId=wx059cd327295ab444&amp;ghName=gh_38274c71b09c&amp;miniFullPath=pro%2Fpages%2Fseq-detail%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%3FhotPointValue%3Da25c2a391b799e6fa1269daeee75b39d%26actId%3D2509180813303542%26inviteUid%3D11220258%26fromShare%3D1%26shareScene%3D10004%26shareByLink%3D1"><strong><span>迷雾花园</span></strong></a><span>】独家冠名 | 今天这期响应小宇宙银河计划的号召，整理盘点一期来投稿一个玄妙奇闻故事之最，我不相信还能有比这更离奇的单集哈哈：）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMiUujY9_bJUQZAHHlLoNMVwi3E.png"><p><span>这期是之前我们群里的“柯南”老师的分享，她从小到大亲历了非常多起命案，简直是柯南附体走哪儿死哪儿🤣</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohjFtfBNa-0cp2EJISPajodYBPW.jpeg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrVkXT8Lm8rPI3hE0ye6JfUz1Qp-.jpeg"><p><span>以下是本期节目里她分享的自己经历的命案（一部分）……</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtuK3cVxSxnqlDPVCnGN0Y4edXTW.png"><p><span>📍如果大家也遇到过带着玄学灵异色彩的遭遇，也是欢迎投稿分享呀，各位可以「</span><a href="https://kaifangmai.cc" data-url="https://kaifangmai.cc"><strong><span>点这里</span></strong></a><span>」或者在公众号「</span><strong><span>玄妙故事局</span></strong><span>」的菜单栏里可以找到投稿进群的入口，跟我们神奇的群友们在一起分享奇遇交换人生。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmsl5x6UgcfKRpwznwpYFK9Abz_G.jpeg"><p><span>照例要感谢【</span><a href="https://hao.qunjielong.com/jump-mp.html?appId=wx059cd327295ab444&amp;ghName=gh_38274c71b09c&amp;miniFullPath=pro%2Fpages%2Fseq-detail%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%3FhotPointValue%3Da25c2a391b799e6fa1269daeee75b39d%26actId%3D2509180813303542%26inviteUid%3D11220258%26fromShare%3D1%26shareScene%3D10004%26shareByLink%3D1" data-url="https://hao.qunjielong.com/jump-mp.html?appId=wx059cd327295ab444&amp;ghName=gh_38274c71b09c&amp;miniFullPath=pro%2Fpages%2Fseq-detail%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%2Fdetail-mutual-sale-child%3FhotPointValue%3Da25c2a391b799e6fa1269daeee75b39d%26actId%3D2509180813303542%26inviteUid%3D11220258%26fromShare%3D1%26shareScene%3D10004%26shareByLink%3D1"><span>迷雾花园</span></a><span>】对本栏目和社群的大力支持，这款意大利气泡甜白口感清甜只有5.5度，非常适合女生八卦聚会或者节日送礼哈，我们群友们的反馈repo都很好，感兴趣的朋友们可以扫码进入小程序选购。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlHM4MqNgZZAZ3d5by-4EilEX3By.png"></figure><p><span>另外也准备了一张迷雾花园茉莉甜白葡萄酒的代金券作为额外的福利，如果正好有姐妹八卦聚会或者节日送礼需要的朋友可以使用抵扣哈😘</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_-Eq735AHtVR5HWLxpC7W4Mfij.png"><p><span>这款意大利气泡甜白口感清甜只有5.5度，夏天冰镇之后非常好喝，最近有群友和朋友吃饭一起干掉了两瓶，然后朋友觉得好喝立刻又下单了两瓶😘</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnjhA4G39pi9ZJyEWAQcVh3B_i5E.png"></figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQiKjaX1qQ-V4TLMKjct_pmseFo.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxrVCsrkdHfPKnEwRrrp1jqwxBv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtoeQOVqOlsuuCTmRAGh8KZeELcu.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
